<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16045" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leader, chief,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἷς δέ τις ἀρχὸς ἀνήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.144
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.493
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰωνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			; <i>ruler,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τειχιούσσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					3d
				</span></i>
			 (Milet., <span class="entity">vi B. C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως</span> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτης</span>), prob. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1014
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρχων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.3301
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἑῴας,</span>
			=
			<i>dux Orientis,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				14.1073
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of a god, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				56.26
			</span></i> (Argos, <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the rectum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				507a33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the anus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Haem.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.20
			</span></i>.</div>
